# Authored concepts for the output policy. No conformance is implied.
meanings
  cnl-default
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "A requested output profile combining controlled-language clarity constraints. Selecting this profile is not evidence that every constraint passed."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Inspect this concept independently of its selected output spelling."
    grounding "https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1584"
  asd-ste100
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "The ASD Simplified Technical English output standard, including its approved technical vocabulary and writing rules."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Inspect this concept independently of its selected output spelling."
    grounding "https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1584"
  ace
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "Attempto Controlled English: a controlled English language with a specified grammar and interpretation into logic."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Inspect this concept independently of its selected output spelling."
    grounding "https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1584"
  gellish
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "A formalized language that expresses typed relations between dictionary concepts identified independently of their natural-language spelling."
