  plain-language
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "Communication whose intended readers can find, understand, and use the information they need. Reader evaluation remains required."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Inspect this concept independently of its selected output spelling."
    grounding "https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1584"
  minimal-english
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "A restricted, cross-translatable explanatory vocabulary based on semantic primes and additional simple semantic molecules."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Inspect this concept independently of its selected output spelling."
